  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate-neutral alternative fuels</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brazil has huge potential in terms of renewable energies &#x2013; and a rapidly increasing demand for fuel. The project developed an international reference model for the production and application of climate-neutral fuels, which are produced using wind and solar energy and used in aviation and other transport segments &#x2013; the electric mobility segment, however, was not included. Fuels were produced and used in a pilot project to prove their feasibility and economic efficiency. The experience gained was systematised and introduced into the international debate on transport sector decarbonisation.</narrative>
  </description>
